---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/CommonPage.astro'

const headings = [
  { depth: 2, slug: 'selected', text: '项目档案' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'github', text: 'GitHub' }
]
---

<PageLayout title='Projects' {headings}>
  <p>这里记录我在前端与 Agent 方向做过的项目。</p>

  <h2 id='selected'>项目档案</h2>
  <div class='not-prose mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2'>
    <article id='ai-interview' class='scroll-mt-24 rounded-2xl border bg-muted px-5 py-4'>
      <h3 class='text-lg font-medium'>AI 语音模拟面试平台</h3>
      <p class='mt-2 text-muted-foreground'>
        面向求职者的实时语音模拟面试工具。按岗位、级别和技术栈配置练习，提供实时字幕、五维评分、回答优点与改进建议。
      </p>
      <div class='mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2'>
        {
          ['Next.js', 'React', 'TypeScript', 'Firebase', 'AICallKit', '阿里云百炼', 'Zod'].map(
            (item) => (
              <span class='rounded-full bg-background px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground'>
                {item}
              </span>
            )
          )
        }
      </div>
      <p class='mt-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground'>
        技术关键词：Zod 校验 · Firebase 登录与数据归属 · 实时字幕 · 评分反馈
      </p>
    </article>

    <article id='memories' class='scroll-mt-24 rounded-2xl border bg-muted px-5 py-4'>
      <h3 class='text-lg font-medium'>Auto-Memories-Doll</h3>
      <p class='mt-2 text-muted-foreground'>
        把本地开发笔记与 Codex 等工具会话整理成 Markdown 知识库，支持语义检索、Tool Calling
        和带来源引用的问答。
      </p>
      <div class='mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2'>
        {
          [
            'Next.js',
            'React',
            'TypeScript',
            'Vercel AI SDK',
            'Embedding',
            'SQLite',
            'USearch',
            'Zod'
          ].map((item) => (
            <span class='rounded-full bg-background px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground'>
              {item}
            </span>
          ))
        }
      </div>
      <p class='mt-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground'>
        技术关键词：任务持久化 · Tool Calling 循环 · 引用校验与拒答 · RAG 检索
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <h2 id='github'>GitHub</h2>
  <p>
    公开仓库可以在 <a href='https://github.com/DA-cpu1' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer'>GitHub</a>
    查看。
  </p>
</PageLayout>
